# My Brain .gitignore, added 2026-09-29 (Path B, Austin approved)
# Why: no ignore file existed, so git tracked 11 GB of media, UI state and cache files,
# and GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB. Notes and working files stay tracked.

# Obsidian UI state (changes on every click, not content)
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json
.trash/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Candid people assessments never leave this computer (CLAUDE.md hard rule 7)
10-Business/people/_private-assessments.md

# Media and bulk binaries belong in SharePoint or Dropbox, linked from notes
20-Brand-Marketing/assets/
20-Brand-Marketing/branding-assets/
20-Brand-Marketing/brochures/
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.zip
# 73 MB deck, over GitHubs 50 MB warning line
80-Finance/planning/2026-executive-strategy/Parakeet - Executive Strategy Meeting v1.pptx
